# ▶️ How to Use the Driver Drowsiness Detection System

This project uses Computer Vision and Embedded Systems to monitor a driver's eye movements in real time and detect drowsiness. When the system detects prolonged eye closure, it triggers warning and emergency alerts using ESP32 hardware and Telegram notifications.

The complete system consists of:
- Python AI detection software
- OpenCV + MediaPipe Computer Vision
- ESP32 embedded controller
- LCD display
- Buzzer and LED alerts
- Telegram Bot notification system

